<title>FRANCE: Gen des Eaux unit wins Egypt water deal.</title>
<headline>Gen des Eaux unit wins Egypt water deal.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>OTV, a subsidiary of Generale des Eaux, said on Tuesday it won a 110 million franc contract to build a water plant in 10 de Ramadan, a new Egyptian town located northeast of Cairo.</p>
<p>The plant is due to have a  daily capacity of 340,000 cubic meters and it is to serve a town of 500,000 people and an industrial area as of the end of 1998, OTV said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
</text>
